# P12 W3-K (docs/phase12-brief.md 3.5, 9 "-contacts-*"): no .vcf files (or no /Contacts: the indexer makes the folder, Q12): Contacts
# shows its empty state, our own sentence, no rows.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p12-contacts-empty.script
# needs: library
# timeout: 180
# log: xidx build kind=2 n=0
# log: contacts open n=0
# nolog: modclass viol
# expect-exists: /Contacts
# golden: skip
# reset: mainmenu

sim_clock 15:06
wait 4000
wait_db 30000
rm_file /Contacts/family.vcf
rm_file /Contacts/work.vcf
rm_file /Contacts/modern.vcf
rm_file /Contacts/big.vcf
rm_file /Contacts/big2000.vcf
rm_file /Contacts/._family.vcf
rm_file /Contacts/readme.txt
rm_file /.rockbox/contacts.idx
rm_file /.rockbox/xindex.owe
rm_file /Contacts
usb_connect
wait 2500
usb_disconnect
wait 150
wait_db 45000
wait 3500
storage_idle
wait 1500
wheel +2            # Main Menu: "Extras"
wait 800
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +2            # Extras: "Contacts" (Clocks, Calendars, Contacts)
wait 800
key SELECT
wait 1200
shot empty
key MENU
wait 1000
shot back_extras
quit
